# Normalise text to LF in the repository; core.autocrlf=true then hands CRLF
# to the Windows working tree, which is what silences the checkout warning.
# All 56 text blobs are already LF, so no `git add --renormalize .` is needed.
* text=auto

# Binary: never let line-ending detection touch these. out/grid.fits is
# currently binary only by NUL-byte sniffing, which is fragile to pin down.
*.fits binary
*.png  binary
*.f32  binary
*.u16  binary
*.pkl  binary
